ceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"@m4gr3d @dsnopek I reviewed the changelogs.\r\n\r\n[NDK 27](https://github.com/android/ndk/wiki/Changelog-r27#changes)'s states:\r\n\r\n> A RISC-V sysroot (AKA riscv64, or rv64) has been added. **It is not supported.** It is present to aid bringup for OS vendors, **but it's not yet a supported Android ABI**. It will not be built by default.\r\n\r\n(emphasis mine)\r\n\r\nI apologise for this massive oversight on my part. I should've verified the official support status before doing this.","created_at":"2025-09-29T21:02:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T21:02:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#discussion_r2389267799","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111034","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2389267799"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#discussion_r2389267799"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111034"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2389267799/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":16,"original_line":16,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2388563884,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2389686246","pull_request_review_id":3282371707,"id":2389686246,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ob7fm","diff_hunk":"@@ -92,9 +92,18 @@ def install_ndk_if_needed(env: \"SConsEnvironment\"):\n         extension = \".bat\" if os.name == \"nt\" else \"\"\n         sdkmanager = os.path.join(sdk_root, \"cmdline-tools\", \"latest\", \"bin\", \"sdkmanager\" + extension)\n         if os.path.exists(sdkmanager):\n-            # Install the Android NDK\n-            print(\"Installing Android NDK...\")\n+            # Format NDK version.\n             ndk_download_args = \"ndk;\" + get_ndk_version()\n+\n+            # Accept licenses. `sdkmanager` expects it to be done as a separate command.\n+            # Fixes issues with GitHub's CI not accepting by default.\n+            print(\"Accepting Android SDK licenses...\")\n+            yessir_process = subprocess.Popen([\"yes\"], stdout=subprocess.PIPE)\n+            subprocess.check_call([sdkmanager, \"--licenses\"], stdin=yessir_process.stdout)\n+            yessir_process.kill()\n+\n+            # Install the Android NDK.\n+            print(\"Installing Android NDK...\")\n             subprocess.check_call([sdkmanager, ndk_download_args])","path":"platform/android/detect.py","commit_id":"7be01cbf42228141e562e02f2741df158c6cbd19","original_commit_id":"e0b168a99e97ef97e2e3f15e9c430029d0161b8a","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false